        <body>
            <div xml:id="d232">

                <pb facs="0375" n="263" xml:id="pg263"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Chargé Fletcher.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-03-01"><hi rendition="#italic">March 1,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wilson directs Mr. Fletcher to send, if possible, copy of text of China’s
                    alleged promise, made in 1899, not to build railways north of Peking without
                    consulting Russia.</p>
            </div>
